# apps/

| App | Package | Notes |
|-----|---------|--------|
| `desktop` | `@involvex/ctrl-desktop` | Electron; starts gateway; safeStorage; Matrix UI |
| `mobile` | `@involvex/ctrl-mobile` | Expo Android; operator runs ADB install/start themselves |
| `web` | `@involvex/ctrl-web` | Expo Router PWA |
| `cli` | `@involvex/ctrl-f5` | Publishable Bun CLI |

## Rules

1. Talk to the gateway via `@involvex/ctrl-i` / protocol types from `ctrl-s`
2. Do not embed or sync SQLite from clients
3. Desktop: keep Electron security defaults (isolation, no nodeIntegration, sandbox, Zod IPC)
4. UI: Matrix theme only (`#00ff66`); exclusive panels on desktop
5. Dev: `bun run dev:desktop` \| `dev:android` \| `dev:cli` — never npm scripts as the primary path
